-252 | `Low` |\n| `docs/design/dao.space.md` | Documentation | +79 | -37 | `Low` |\n| `docs/design/dao.space.index.md` | Documentation | +53 | -29 | `Low` |\n| `test/dao/space/index_test.cljc` | Tests | +52 | -26 | `Low` |\n| `docs/dao.space.stigmergy.md` | Documentation | +22 | -15 | `Low` |\n| `test/dao/space/stigmergy_test.clj` | Tests | +24 | -12 | `Low` |\n| `docs/design/adr/0003-dao-space-is-the-event-medium.md` | Documentation | +26 | -0 | `Low` |\n| `test/dao/space/query_test.cljc` | Tests | +5 | -6 | `Low` |\n| `docs/design/dao.stream.md` | Documentation | +3 | -2 | `Low` |\n\n## Reviewer Focus & Recommendations\n- 🗄️ **Database:** Verify migration rollback compatibility, index performance, and transaction boundaries.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
